File Index: 82 of 109
Audio ID: 7224853722524945704
Audio Duration: 7m 33.1s (453.12s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 12:27:49 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 0.99)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,260] | Elapsed:  13.88s | Words: 11 | Text: 人與人之間的差距在哪啊
Segment #2   [00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:03,560] | Elapsed:  13.88s | Words: 7  | Text: 這個世界上有四種人
Segment #3   [00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:07,480] | Elapsed:  13.88s | Words: 12 | Text: 聖人 聰明人 一般人和聰明人
Segment #4   [00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:09,460] | Elapsed:  13.88s | Words: 9  | Text: 那都是兩個肩膀上一個腦袋
Segment #5   [00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:12,340] | Elapsed:  13.88s | Words: 11 | Text: 為什麼人之一生差距會如此之大
Segment #6   [00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:14,520] | Elapsed:  13.88s | Words: 11 | Text: 事實上人與人之間的區別
Segment #7   [00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:17,240] | Elapsed:  13.88s | Words: 13 | Text: 我感覺不是在於肚子裡喝了多少墨水
Segment #8   [00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:18,580] | Elapsed:  13.88s | Words: 7  | Text: 拿到多多的學歷
Segment #9   [00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:20,260] | Elapsed:  13.88s | Words: 8  | Text: 擁有多牛逼得直撐
Segment #10  [00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:23,120] | Elapsed:  13.88s | Words: 13 | Text: 本質的區別就是在於你是否能夠
Segment #11  [00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:25,580] | Elapsed:  13.88s | Words: 10 | Text: 達人心之力進變化之力
Segment #12  [00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:27,320] | Elapsed:  13.88s | Words: 7  | Text: 那個電影很經典啊
Segment #13  [00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:29,220] | Elapsed:  13.88s | Words: 9  | Text: 那個教父我不知道你們有沒有看過啊
Segment #14  [00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:32,140] | Elapsed:  29.54s | Words: 11 | Text: 花一秒鐘看清失誤本質的人
Segment #15  [00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:34,560] | Elapsed:  29.54s | Words: 14 | Text: 和花半輩子都看不清失誤本質的人
Segment #16  [00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:37,280] | Elapsed:  29.54s | Words: 13 | Text: 那肯定過了兩種戒然不同的生活啊
Segment #17  [00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:40,240] | Elapsed:  29.54s | Words: 12 | Text: 那說白了無論是混色會妝兒
Segment #18  [00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:41,520] | Elapsed:  29.54s | Words: 6  | Text: 還是在職場謀生
Segment #19  [00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:42,680] | Elapsed:  29.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 還是家庭生活
Segment #20  [00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:45,640] | Elapsed:  29.54s | Words: 16 | Text: 你是不是都要遂應失誤的發展和變化規律
Segment #21  [00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:48,840] | Elapsed:  29.54s | Words: 16 | Text: 這才是決定你人生境界最核心的條件
Segment #22  [00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:51,300] | Elapsed:  29.54s | Words: 10 | Text: 這個點決定了你是一個聰明人
Segment #23  [00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:52,120] | Elapsed:  29.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 還是一個傻子
Segment #24  [00:00:52,660 --> 00:00:55,100] | Elapsed:  29.54s | Words: 13 | Text: 你只要想去過和普通人不同的生活
Segment #25  [00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:56,580] | Elapsed:  29.54s | Words: 7  | Text: 想去做一個優秀的人
Segment #26  [00:00:56,580 --> 00:00:59,400] | Elapsed:  44.25s | Words: 14 | Text: 那你就要比別人付出更加多的努力
Segment #27  [00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:00,760] | Elapsed:  44.25s | Words: 4  | Text: 但是還聽好了
Segment #28  [00:01:00,760 --> 00:01:01,940] | Elapsed:  44.25s | Words: 6  | Text: QQ還有一句話
Segment #29  [00:01:01,940 --> 00:01:03,700] | Elapsed:  44.25s | Words: 7  | Text: 光努力是沒用的
Segment #30  [00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:05,840] | Elapsed:  44.25s | Words: 11 | Text: 有句話叫做選擇大於努力
Segment #31  [00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:07,900] | Elapsed:  44.25s | Words: 12 | Text: 那我怎麼樣能選擇一個正確的賽道
Segment #32  [00:01:08,320 --> 00:01:10,200] | Elapsed:  44.25s | Words: 8  | Text: 首先你要用足夠的認知
Segment #33  [00:01:10,740 --> 00:01:12,800] | Elapsed:  44.25s | Words: 10 | Text: 你要能掌握規律再去做事
Segment #34  [00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:16,060] | Elapsed:  44.25s | Words: 8  | Text: 先看到全局再看到局部
Segment #35  [00:01:16,060 --> 00:01:18,760] | Elapsed:  44.25s | Words: 9  | Text: 先搞清楚為什麼再去想怎麼做
Segment #36  [00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:20,400] | Elapsed:  44.25s | Words: 8  | Text: 老天們學會做事之前
Segment #37  [00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:22,040] | Elapsed:  44.25s | Words: 8  | Text: 你要先學會如何怎麼做人
Segment #38  [00:01:22,580 --> 00:01:24,460] | Elapsed:  44.25s | Words: 8  | Text: 其實我很喜歡看歷史書啊
Segment #39  [00:01:24,460 --> 00:01:27,560] | Elapsed:  59.92s | Words: 14 | Text: 你縱觀歷史幾千年人類歷史發展
Segment #40  [00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:30,160] | Elapsed:  59.92s | Words: 13 | Text: 你會發現那些能幹大事的大用途
Segment #41  [00:01:30,160 --> 00:01:33,640] | Elapsed:  59.92s | Words: 14 | Text: 是不是都能做到是大體之進退分清路
Segment #42  [00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:35,640] | Elapsed:  59.92s | Words: 11 | Text: 人在什麼階段該做什麼樣事對不對
Segment #43  [00:01:36,360 --> 00:01:39,500] | Elapsed:  59.92s | Words: 10 | Text: 做好當下什麼時候該做什麼事
Segment #44  [00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:41,720] | Elapsed:  59.92s | Words: 9  | Text: 應該順應哪些循環規律
Segment #45  [00:01:42,300 --> 00:01:43,620] | Elapsed:  59.92s | Words: 6  | Text: 這些人心裡都有數
Segment #46  [00:01:43,620 --> 00:01:44,720] | Elapsed:  59.92s | Words: 7  | Text: 你心裡也要有數
Segment #47  [00:01:44,720 --> 00:01:47,380] | Elapsed:  59.92s | Words: 13 | Text: 別飄了別心必天高命必止飽了
Segment #48  [00:01:47,380 --> 00:01:50,260] | Elapsed:  59.92s | Words: 9  | Text: 下來看一看民間生活吧是不是
Segment #49  [00:01:50,800 --> 00:01:52,680] | Elapsed:  59.92s | Words: 9  | Text: 當你連飯都吃不上的時候
Segment #50  [00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:54,980] | Elapsed:  74.47s | Words: 14 | Text: 你不要想老實來世和大滅畜的事了
Segment #51  [00:01:54,980 --> 00:01:56,580] | Elapsed:  74.47s | Words: 8  | Text: 先解決當下的困境
Segment #52  [00:01:57,140 --> 00:02:00,440] | Elapsed:  74.47s | Words: 9  | Text: 其實我感覺我們中國人很講究
Segment #53  [00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:02,120] | Elapsed:  74.47s | Words: 4  | Text: 到底什麼是事
Segment #54  [00:02:02,980 --> 00:02:04,280] | Elapsed:  74.47s | Words: 6  | Text: 事能的這個事啊
Segment #55  [00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:05,520] | Elapsed:  74.47s | Words: 6  | Text: 很多人感覺很模糊
Segment #56  [00:02:05,520 --> 00:02:07,960] | Elapsed:  74.47s | Words: 7  | Text: 其實我感覺事就是規律
Segment #57  [00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:08,780] | Elapsed:  74.47s | Words: 3  | Text: 也是趨勢
Segment #58  [00:02:08,780 --> 00:02:10,700] | Elapsed:  74.47s | Words: 8  | Text: 春天播種秋天收穫
Segment #59  [00:02:10,700 --> 00:02:12,340] | Elapsed:  74.47s | Words: 8  | Text: 南大曲奇生老必死
Segment #60  [00:02:12,340 --> 00:02:14,660] | Elapsed:  74.47s | Words: 8  | Text: 生老必死誤極必反
Segment #61  [00:02:14,660 --> 00:02:15,680] | Elapsed:  74.47s | Words: 5  | Text: 這是自然的事
Segment #62  [00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:18,800] | Elapsed:  74.47s | Words: 10 | Text: 我們要遵守物逆必遭天前
Segment #63  [00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:21,380] | Elapsed:  74.47s | Words: 4  | Text: 天下是吧
Segment #64  [00:02:21,380 --> 00:02:23,120] | Elapsed:  92.29s | Words: 8  | Text: 喝酒必分分酒必合
Segment #65  [00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:25,860] | Elapsed:  92.29s | Words: 10 | Text: 是人息息攔攔結尾力攔
Segment #66  [00:02:25,860 --> 00:02:26,760] | Elapsed:  92.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 做完門掙錢
Segment #67  [00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:29,680] | Elapsed:  92.29s | Words: 11 | Text: 再有講究一個天事地利人和
Segment #68  [00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:31,520] | Elapsed:  92.29s | Words: 8  | Text: 這也是一個事人事的事
Segment #69  [00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:33,360] | Elapsed:  92.29s | Words: 7  | Text: 我們要創造和利用
Segment #70  [00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:35,160] | Elapsed:  92.29s | Words: 9  | Text: 你說諸葛亮牛逼吧牛逼
Segment #71  [00:02:35,160 --> 00:02:36,440] | Elapsed:  92.29s | Words: 7  | Text: 你說他三股毛路對吧
Segment #72  [00:02:36,440 --> 00:02:37,280] | Elapsed:  92.30s | Words: 3  | Text: 對也不對
Segment #73  [00:02:38,260 --> 00:02:39,040] | Elapsed:  92.30s | Words: 3  | Text: 我想問一下
Segment #74  [00:02:39,040 --> 00:02:40,360] | Elapsed:  92.30s | Words: 8  | Text: 他的選擇是正確的嗎
Segment #75  [00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:41,640] | Elapsed:  92.30s | Words: 4  | Text: 恐怕未必
Segment #76  [00:02:41,640 --> 00:02:44,040] | Elapsed:  92.30s | Words: 10 | Text: 諸葛亮臥居南洋這麼多年
Segment #77  [00:02:44,040 --> 00:02:45,920] | Elapsed:  92.30s | Words: 8  | Text: 不是因為他熱愛田園生活
Segment #78  [00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:48,620] | Elapsed:  92.30s | Words: 10 | Text: 是因為天下大亂諸侯並且
Segment #79  [00:02:48,620 --> 00:02:50,540] | Elapsed:  92.30s | Words: 8  | Text: 作為一個兇有萬策的人
Segment #80  [00:02:50,540 --> 00:02:52,740] | Elapsed: 109.48s | Words: 9  | Text: 他怎麼甘心去歸隱田裡
Segment #81  [00:02:52,740 --> 00:02:54,400] | Elapsed: 109.48s | Words: 5  | Text: 歸隱山林呢
Segment #82  [00:02:55,040 --> 00:02:56,320] | Elapsed: 109.48s | Words: 6  | Text: 就找個地方躲起來
Segment #83  [00:02:56,320 --> 00:02:57,620] | Elapsed: 109.48s | Words: 6  | Text: 是不是他也不願意
Segment #84  [00:02:57,620 --> 00:02:59,320] | Elapsed: 109.48s | Words: 9  | Text: 無非是關天下之大事
Segment #85  [00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:00,900] | Elapsed: 109.48s | Words: 9  | Text: 為自己去挑選一個好童年
Segment #86  [00:03:01,540 --> 00:03:02,480] | Elapsed: 109.48s | Words: 7  | Text: 最後他選擇了劉備
Segment #87  [00:03:02,480 --> 00:03:04,500] | Elapsed: 109.48s | Words: 8  | Text: 而不是操守豁出順懸
Segment #88  [00:03:04,500 --> 00:03:05,980] | Elapsed: 109.48s | Words: 9  | Text: 以在道德立場上來講
Segment #89  [00:03:05,980 --> 00:03:07,080] | Elapsed: 109.48s | Words: 4  | Text: 可能是對的
Segment #90  [00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:09,600] | Elapsed: 109.48s | Words: 9  | Text: 但是在本質來看是錯的
Segment #91  [00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:11,240] | Elapsed: 109.48s | Words: 10 | Text: 他雖然遂應了道德之名
Segment #92  [00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:13,180] | Elapsed: 109.48s | Words: 9  | Text: 卻誤逆了天下之大事
Segment #93  [00:03:13,180 --> 00:03:15,100] | Elapsed: 109.48s | Words: 8  | Text: 老鐵別狂復漢師了
Segment #94  [00:03:15,100 --> 00:03:16,000] | Elapsed: 109.48s | Words: 4  | Text: 已經沒氣了
Segment #95  [00:03:16,540 --> 00:03:18,040] | Elapsed: 109.48s | Words: 9  | Text: 氣數將近操作多好呀
Segment #96  [00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:20,620] | Elapsed: 127.53s | Words: 12 | Text: 雄軍北方擁有最廣闊的土地
Segment #97  [00:03:20,620 --> 00:03:22,100] | Elapsed: 127.53s | Words: 7  | Text: 和最豐富的資源
Segment #98  [00:03:22,100 --> 00:03:22,860] | Elapsed: 127.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 人口也多
Segment #99  [00:03:22,860 --> 00:03:24,500] | Elapsed: 127.54s | Words: 7  | Text: 模式和將領也多
Segment #100 [00:03:24,500 --> 00:03:25,800] | Elapsed: 127.54s | Words: 8  | Text: 你從軍事角度來講
Segment #101 [00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:27,820] | Elapsed: 127.54s | Words: 11 | Text: 他還佔據了最有力的地形
Segment #102 [00:03:27,820 --> 00:03:29,080] | Elapsed: 127.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 以北望南
Segment #103 [00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:30,300] | Elapsed: 127.54s | Words: 6  | Text: 是吧 攻守自如
Segment #104 [00:03:30,300 --> 00:03:32,540] | Elapsed: 127.54s | Words: 9  | Text: 那歷史的結果我們也看到了
Segment #105 [00:03:32,540 --> 00:03:33,680] | Elapsed: 127.54s | Words: 7  | Text: 做個量出於人意
Segment #106 [00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:34,720] | Elapsed: 127.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 人意道德
Segment #107 [00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:35,480] | Elapsed: 127.54s | Words: 5  | Text: 投靠了劉備
Segment #108 [00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:36,920] | Elapsed: 127.54s | Words: 6  | Text: 親戚一生才華
Segment #109 [00:03:36,920 --> 00:03:37,940] | Elapsed: 127.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 鞠躬進翠
Segment #110 [00:03:37,940 --> 00:03:39,540] | Elapsed: 127.54s | Words: 7  | Text: 罵把自己活活類似
Segment #111 [00:03:39,540 --> 00:03:40,720] | Elapsed: 127.54s | Words: 3  | Text: 也只是幫
Segment #112 [00:03:40,720 --> 00:03:42,680] | Elapsed: 127.54s | Words: 11 | Text: 蘇漢維持了這幾十年的光景
Segment #113 [00:03:43,180 --> 00:03:43,820] | Elapsed: 127.54s | Words: 2  | Text: 所以說
Segment #114 [00:03:43,820 --> 00:03:45,820] | Elapsed: 127.54s | Words: 8  | Text: 出來混的人一定要明白這個道理
Segment #115 [00:03:45,820 --> 00:03:47,400] | Elapsed: 127.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 順勢而為
Segment #116 [00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:48,420] | Elapsed: 146.10s | Words: 4  | Text: 即使你是一個
Segment #117 [00:03:48,420 --> 00:03:49,880] | Elapsed: 146.10s | Words: 7  | Text: 千年難遇的奇才
Segment #118 [00:03:49,880 --> 00:03:50,480] | Elapsed: 146.10s | Words: 3  | Text: 那又怎麼樣
Segment #119 [00:03:50,480 --> 00:03:52,320] | Elapsed: 146.10s | Words: 6  | Text: 做個量就是例子
Segment #120 [00:03:52,320 --> 00:03:53,400] | Elapsed: 146.10s | Words: 6  | Text: 你反觀司馬醫
Segment #121 [00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:55,020] | Elapsed: 146.10s | Words: 6  | Text: 道理就很簡單了
Segment #122 [00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:56,900] | Elapsed: 146.10s | Words: 7  | Text: 做人就做司馬醫
Segment #123 [00:03:56,900 --> 00:03:57,600] | Elapsed: 146.10s | Words: 2  | Text: 要做
Segment #124 [00:03:58,040 --> 00:03:59,480] | Elapsed: 146.10s | Words: 7  | Text: 哪怕遭萬人唾棄
Segment #125 [00:03:59,480 --> 00:04:00,780] | Elapsed: 146.10s | Words: 5  | Text: 你看世人皆罵
Segment #126 [00:04:00,780 --> 00:04:01,640] | Elapsed: 146.10s | Words: 4  | Text: 司馬老子
Segment #127 [00:04:01,640 --> 00:04:02,300] | Elapsed: 146.10s | Words: 3  | Text: 這又如何
Segment #128 [00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:04,000] | Elapsed: 146.10s | Words: 5  | Text: 我寧願做一個
Segment #129 [00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,400] | Elapsed: 146.10s | Words: 9  | Text: 背負了所有罵名的惡人
Segment #130 [00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:06,560] | Elapsed: 146.10s | Words: 7  | Text: 我也不願意去做一個
Segment #131 [00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:08,360] | Elapsed: 146.10s | Words: 11 | Text: 在深夜里抱頭痛哭的好人
Segment #132 [00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:10,140] | Elapsed: 146.10s | Words: 7  | Text: 沒有對比就沒有傷害
Segment #133 [00:04:10,140 --> 00:04:11,040] | Elapsed: 146.10s | Words: 6  | Text: 你只要一對比
Segment #134 [00:04:11,040 --> 00:04:12,280] | Elapsed: 146.10s | Words: 8  | Text: 你會發現我操司馬醫
Segment #135 [00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:13,360] | Elapsed: 146.10s | Words: 7  | Text: 他家族太聰明了
Segment #136 [00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:15,500] | Elapsed: 146.10s | Words: 8  | Text: 不但順勢投靠朝位
Segment #137 [00:04:15,500 --> 00:04:16,680] | Elapsed: 146.10s | Words: 6  | Text: 還會借殼生蛋
Segment #138 [00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:18,120] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 7  | Text: 利用朝位的強勢
Segment #139 [00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,460] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 7  | Text: 慢慢擊斷自己的實力
Segment #140 [00:04:19,460 --> 00:04:20,340] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 5  | Text: 最後取而代之
Segment #141 [00:04:21,100 --> 00:04:21,920] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 4  | Text: 真的建議你們
Segment #142 [00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:22,760] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 6  | Text: 去讀一讀三國
Segment #143 [00:04:22,760 --> 00:04:24,320] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 8  | Text: 里邊的一些全謀之道
Segment #144 [00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:25,120] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 3  | Text: 你可能感覺
Segment #145 [00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:26,500] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 5  | Text: 這是帝王之術
Segment #146 [00:04:26,500 --> 00:04:27,600] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 6  | Text: 只有帝王能運用
Segment #147 [00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:28,360] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 6  | Text: 我一個小老百姓
Segment #148 [00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:29,680] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 5  | Text: 我怎麼和我的生活
Segment #149 [00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:30,320] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 4  | Text: 毫不搭邊
Segment #150 [00:04:30,320 --> 00:04:31,360] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 3  | Text: 和我的生活
Segment #151 [00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:32,200] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 4  | Text: 沒有任何關係
Segment #152 [00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:33,360] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 5  | Text: 其實我跟妳說
Segment #153 [00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:34,820] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 7  | Text: 很多東西存在即合理
Segment #154 [00:04:34,820 --> 00:04:35,780] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 3  | Text: 它就是我們
Segment #155 [00:04:35,780 --> 00:04:36,640] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 5  | Text: 普通大眾的
Segment #156 [00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:37,720] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 7  | Text: 一個最真實的寫照
Segment #157 [00:04:38,140 --> 00:04:38,760] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 3  | Text: 我問一下
Segment #158 [00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:39,580] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 6  | Text: 屏幕前的妳們
Segment #159 [00:04:40,640 --> 00:04:41,860] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 7  | Text: 如果說妳有一個親戚
Segment #160 [00:04:41,860 --> 00:04:42,760] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 6  | Text: 和妳在一起創業
Segment #161 [00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:43,480] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 5  | Text: 妳和他在一起
Segment #162 [00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:44,440] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 7  | Text: 一年能振一百萬
Segment #163 [00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:45,520] | Elapsed: 165.23s | Words: 4  | Text: 但是兩年之後
Segment #164 [00:04:45,520 --> 00:04:46,580] | Elapsed: 183.09s | Words: 7  | Text: 這個公司就倒閉了
Segment #165 [00:04:46,580 --> 00:04:48,240] | Elapsed: 183.09s | Words: 6  | Text: 現在如果有人來挖妳
Segment #166 [00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:49,960] | Elapsed: 183.09s | Words: 9  | Text: 讓妳一年能振一千萬
Segment #167 [00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:50,560] | Elapsed: 183.09s | Words: 3  | Text: 這個公司
Segment #168 [00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:51,720] | Elapsed: 183.09s | Words: 7  | Text: 還能做得很長久
Segment #169 [00:04:52,080 --> 00:04:52,940] | Elapsed: 183.09s | Words: 5  | Text: 然後妳會擁有
Segment #170 [00:04:52,940 --> 00:04:53,980] | Elapsed: 183.09s | Words: 6  | Text: 更好的平台發展
Segment #171 [00:04:53,980 --> 00:04:54,880] | Elapsed: 183.09s | Words: 4  | Text: 妳會去嗎
Segment #172 [00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:55,740] | Elapsed: 183.09s | Words: 4  | Text: 妳一定會去
Segment #173 [00:04:55,740 --> 00:04:57,580] | Elapsed: 183.09s | Words: 6  | Text: 考慮都不會考慮
Segment #174 [00:04:57,580 --> 00:04:58,600] | Elapsed: 183.09s | Words: 7  | Text: 那妳不就相當於
Segment #175 [00:04:58,600 --> 00:04:59,060] | Elapsed: 183.09s | Words: 3  | Text: 扮演了
Segment #176 [00:04:59,060 --> 00:05:00,080] | Elapsed: 183.09s | Words: 8  | Text: 陳情諸位亮的角色
Segment #177 [00:05:00,080 --> 00:05:00,560] | Elapsed: 183.09s | Words: 1  | Text: 對吧
Segment #178 [00:05:01,180 --> 00:05:02,380] | Elapsed: 183.09s | Words: 7  | Text: 三國的思想基礎
Segment #179 [00:05:02,380 --> 00:05:04,560] | Elapsed: 183.09s | Words: 5  | Text: 是順天應人
Segment #180 [00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:06,560] | Elapsed: 183.09s | Words: 4  | Text: 認清形勢
Segment #181 [00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:08,700] | Elapsed: 183.09s | Words: 8  | Text: 利用大勢所產生的
Segment #182 [00:05:08,700 --> 00:05:09,260] | Elapsed: 183.09s | Words: 4  | Text: 巨大力量
Segment #183 [00:05:09,260 --> 00:05:10,500] | Elapsed: 183.09s | Words: 6  | Text: 推動我們去做事
Segment #184 [00:05:11,100 --> 00:05:11,740] | Elapsed: 183.09s | Words: 2  | Text: 明白嗎
Segment #185 [00:05:11,740 --> 00:05:13,120] | Elapsed: 183.09s | Words: 4  | Text: 名利雙收
Segment #186 [00:05:13,860 --> 00:05:15,140] | Elapsed: 183.09s | Words: 8  | Text: 三國里面所體現的
Segment #187 [00:05:15,140 --> 00:05:16,160] | Elapsed: 200.41s | Words: 7  | Text: 對於形勢的判斷
Segment #188 [00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:17,240] | Elapsed: 200.41s | Words: 3  | Text: 還有對於
Segment #189 [00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:18,180] | Elapsed: 200.41s | Words: 5  | Text: 人性的揣摩
Segment #190 [00:05:18,180 --> 00:05:19,300] | Elapsed: 200.41s | Words: 6  | Text: 各種事物之間
Segment #191 [00:05:19,300 --> 00:05:20,460] | Elapsed: 200.41s | Words: 6  | Text: 關聯的這種分析
Segment #192 [00:05:20,460 --> 00:05:21,660] | Elapsed: 200.41s | Words: 4  | Text: 然後妳怎樣去
Segment #193 [00:05:21,660 --> 00:05:22,960] | Elapsed: 200.41s | Words: 7  | Text: 做出正確的判斷
Segment #194 [00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,040] | Elapsed: 200.41s | Words: 3  | Text: 為什麼要去
Segment #195 [00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:25,860] | Elapsed: 200.41s | Words: 4  | Text: 洞察人心
Segment #196 [00:05:25,860 --> 00:05:27,400] | Elapsed: 200.41s | Words: 6  | Text: 因為人心格鬥皮
Segment #197 [00:05:28,020 --> 00:05:29,500] | Elapsed: 200.41s | Words: 6  | Text: 人心充滿貪欲
Segment #198 [00:05:29,500 --> 00:05:31,040] | Elapsed: 200.41s | Words: 9  | Text: 有著各種各樣的慾望
Segment #199 [00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:31,800] | Elapsed: 200.41s | Words: 1  | Text: 是不是
Segment #200 [00:05:32,260 --> 00:05:33,240] | Elapsed: 200.41s | Words: 4  | Text: 妳比如說她
Segment #201 [00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:34,080] | Elapsed: 200.41s | Words: 3  | Text: 妳看到她
Segment #202 [00:05:34,080 --> 00:05:34,980] | Elapsed: 200.41s | Words: 4  | Text: 跟我很好嗎
Segment #203 [00:05:34,980 --> 00:05:36,000] | Elapsed: 200.41s | Words: 5  | Text: 也許並不是這樣
Segment #204 [00:05:36,700 --> 00:05:38,060] | Elapsed: 200.41s | Words: 6  | Text: 這是人性的本質
Segment #205 [00:05:38,060 --> 00:05:39,140] | Elapsed: 200.41s | Words: 6  | Text: 人在這個地球上
Segment #206 [00:05:39,140 --> 00:05:40,280] | Elapsed: 200.41s | Words: 7  | Text: 玩了她媽幾千年
Segment #207 [00:05:40,280 --> 00:05:41,280] | Elapsed: 200.41s | Words: 6  | Text: 說白了就是一部
Segment #208 [00:05:41,280 --> 00:05:43,420] | Elapsed: 200.41s | Words: 6  | Text: 有貪欲豬在的
Segment #209 [00:05:44,060 --> 00:05:46,080] | Elapsed: 217.15s | Words: 8  | Text: 殘酷無情的淘汰史
Segment #210 [00:05:46,080 --> 00:05:47,220] | Elapsed: 217.15s | Words: 3  | Text: 競爭史
Segment #211 [00:05:47,220 --> 00:05:48,240] | Elapsed: 217.15s | Words: 4  | Text: 三國是如此
Segment #212 [00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:49,900] | Elapsed: 217.15s | Words: 6  | Text: 現代社會也是如此
Segment #213 [00:05:50,420 --> 00:05:52,740] | Elapsed: 217.15s | Words: 7  | Text: 為名利奔波追逐
Segment #214 [00:05:52,740 --> 00:05:54,720] | Elapsed: 217.15s | Words: 7  | Text: 為錢財突破血流
Segment #215 [00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:56,280] | Elapsed: 217.15s | Words: 3  | Text: 為權欲
Segment #216 [00:05:56,280 --> 00:05:57,280] | Elapsed: 217.15s | Words: 4  | Text: 妳死我活
Segment #217 [00:05:57,280 --> 00:05:58,460] | Elapsed: 217.15s | Words: 7  | Text: 妳要不懂點三國
Segment #218 [00:05:58,460 --> 00:05:59,080] | Elapsed: 217.15s | Words: 4  | Text: 妳要還覺得
Segment #219 [00:05:59,080 --> 00:06:00,240] | Elapsed: 217.15s | Words: 6  | Text: 每個人都是小白兔
Segment #220 [00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:01,520] | Elapsed: 217.15s | Words: 4  | Text: 妳可能大概率
Segment #221 [00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:02,360] | Elapsed: 217.15s | Words: 5  | Text: 只能活三級
Segment #222 [00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,540] | Elapsed: 217.15s | Words: 3  | Text: 那如果說
Segment #223 [00:06:03,540 --> 00:06:04,120] | Elapsed: 217.15s | Words: 3  | Text: 妳沒有時間
Segment #224 [00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:04,820] | Elapsed: 217.15s | Words: 4  | Text: 去看三國
Segment #225 [00:06:04,820 --> 00:06:05,540] | Elapsed: 217.15s | Words: 3  | Text: 妳也可以看看
Segment #226 [00:06:05,540 --> 00:06:06,460] | Elapsed: 217.15s | Words: 6  | Text: 小豆的短視頻
Segment #227 [00:06:06,460 --> 00:06:08,020] | Elapsed: 217.15s | Words: 5  | Text: 有人覺得我拍的是
Segment #228 [00:06:08,020 --> 00:06:08,440] | Elapsed: 217.15s | Words: 2  | Text: 雞湯
Segment #229 [00:06:08,440 --> 00:06:09,520] | Elapsed: 217.15s | Words: 3  | Text: 但是我感覺
Segment #230 [00:06:09,520 --> 00:06:10,320] | Elapsed: 217.15s | Words: 4  | Text: 我就是對於
Segment #231 [00:06:10,320 --> 00:06:11,040] | Elapsed: 217.15s | Words: 5  | Text: 當下的形勢
Segment #232 [00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,100] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 7  | Text: 有一個我自己的看法
Segment #233 [00:06:12,100 --> 00:06:12,880] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 4  | Text: 妳可以認同
Segment #234 [00:06:12,880 --> 00:06:13,880] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 5  | Text: 妳也可以罵我沒關係
Segment #235 [00:06:13,880 --> 00:06:15,380] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 6  | Text: 這就像人心一樣
Segment #236 [00:06:15,380 --> 00:06:16,720] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 5  | Text: 人心隔度屁
Segment #237 [00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:18,460] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 6  | Text: 妳不懂人心是什麼
Segment #238 [00:06:18,460 --> 00:06:19,160] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 4  | Text: 就千萬不要
Segment #239 [00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:20,060] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 6  | Text: 跟別人打交道
Segment #240 [00:06:20,060 --> 00:06:21,040] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 3  | Text: 容易被騙
Segment #241 [00:06:21,460 --> 00:06:22,980] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 8  | Text: 千萬不要被別人當成
Segment #242 [00:06:22,980 --> 00:06:23,700] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 4  | Text: 傻瓜成為
Segment #243 [00:06:23,700 --> 00:06:24,800] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 7  | Text: 他腳下的電腳石
Segment #244 [00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:25,680] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 3  | Text: 犧牲屁
Segment #245 [00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:26,580] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 3  | Text: 妳要知道
Segment #246 [00:06:26,580 --> 00:06:28,080] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 5  | Text: 人心是黑的
Segment #247 [00:06:28,080 --> 00:06:30,000] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 8  | Text: 妳要對人多一份小心
Segment #248 [00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:31,300] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 7  | Text: 不要輕易上當受騙
Segment #249 [00:06:31,300 --> 00:06:32,060] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 3  | Text: 這東西沒錯
Segment #250 [00:06:32,520 --> 00:06:33,580] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 5  | Text: 在商業領域
Segment #251 [00:06:33,580 --> 00:06:34,700] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 6  | Text: 商人都要根據
Segment #252 [00:06:34,700 --> 00:06:36,400] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 5  | Text: 市場的需求
Segment #253 [00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:37,420] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 5  | Text: 去開發產品
Segment #254 [00:06:38,020 --> 00:06:38,640] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 2  | Text: 因為什麼
Segment #255 [00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:40,440] | Elapsed: 234.43s | Words: 6  | Text: 需求帶動發展
Segment #256 [00:06:40,440 --> 00:06:42,620] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 8  | Text: 這是商場的順天應用
Segment #257 [00:06:42,620 --> 00:06:43,980] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 7  | Text: 當妳看到某種商品
Segment #258 [00:06:43,980 --> 00:06:45,000] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 消除火爆的時候
Segment #259 [00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:45,620] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 4  | Text: 妳就跟風
Segment #260 [00:06:45,620 --> 00:06:46,820] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 盲目的生產
Segment #261 [00:06:46,820 --> 00:06:47,660] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 4  | Text: 老鐵生產
Segment #262 [00:06:47,660 --> 00:06:48,140] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 2  | Text: 背貨
Segment #263 [00:06:48,140 --> 00:06:49,640] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 7  | Text: 最後有可能配個底調
Segment #264 [00:06:49,640 --> 00:06:51,160] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 因為大家都會跟風
Segment #265 [00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:52,840] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 7  | Text: 造成市場的報後
Segment #266 [00:06:52,840 --> 00:06:53,520] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 4  | Text: 有一些商品
Segment #267 [00:06:53,520 --> 00:06:54,420] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 可能無人為情
Segment #268 [00:06:54,420 --> 00:06:55,260] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 妳都不會想到
Segment #269 [00:06:55,260 --> 00:06:56,160] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 這個東西生產出來
Segment #270 [00:06:56,160 --> 00:06:56,740] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 3  | Text: 會有人買
Segment #271 [00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:57,880] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 3  | Text: 但是有可能
Segment #272 [00:06:57,880 --> 00:06:58,680] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 4  | Text: 妳就會錯過
Segment #273 [00:06:58,680 --> 00:06:59,800] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 最佳的商機
Segment #274 [00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:01,280] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 6  | Text: 因為市場的需求
Segment #275 [00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:01,920] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 4  | Text: 正在培育
Segment #276 [00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:03,000] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 4  | Text: 妳只有具備
Segment #277 [00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:04,000] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 全局的眼光
Segment #278 [00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:06,360] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 全局的眼光
Segment #279 [00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:07,040] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 3  | Text: 才能發現
Segment #280 [00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:08,280] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 3  | Text: 這些危險
Segment #281 [00:07:08,280 --> 00:07:09,320] | Elapsed: 251.61s | Words: 5  | Text: 和利好的信號
Segment #282 [00:07:09,320 --> 00:07:10,120] | Elapsed: 268.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 妳像我做
Segment #283 [00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:10,880] | Elapsed: 268.53s | Words: 6  | Text: 直播待會也是一樣
Segment #284 [00:07:10,880 --> 00:07:11,420] | Elapsed: 268.53s | Words: 3  | Text: 很多人說
Segment #285 [00:07:11,420 --> 00:07:12,320] | Elapsed: 268.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 服裝不要做
Segment #286 [00:07:12,320 --> 00:07:13,040] | Elapsed: 268.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 牙鋪存在
Segment #287 [00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:13,580] | Elapsed: 268.53s | Words: 3  | Text: 吃工鏈
Segment #288 [00:07:13,580 --> 00:07:15,040] | Elapsed: 268.53s | Words: 6  | Text: 妳去賣酒不好嗎
Segment #289 [00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:15,960] | Elapsed: 268.53s | Words: 5  | Text: 賣茶也不好嗎
Segment #290 [00:07:15,960 --> 00:07:16,680] | Elapsed: 268.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 這些事都不好
Segment #291 [00:07:17,100 --> 00:07:17,940] | Elapsed: 268.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 我只想說
Segment #292 [00:07:17,940 --> 00:07:18,860] | Elapsed: 268.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 實踐才是
Segment #293 [00:07:18,860 --> 00:07:20,080] | Elapsed: 268.53s | Words: 9  | Text: 檢驗真理的唯一標準
Segment #294 [00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:21,180] | Elapsed: 268.53s | Words: 3  | Text: 怎麼檢驗
Segment #295 [00:07:21,180 --> 00:07:21,780] | Elapsed: 268.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 妳比方說
Segment #296 [00:07:21,780 --> 00:07:22,700] | Elapsed: 268.53s | Words: 5  | Text: 我之前賣貨之前
Segment #297 [00:07:22,700 --> 00:07:23,720] | Elapsed: 268.54s | Words: 5  | Text: 我騎自行車
Segment #298 [00:07:23,720 --> 00:07:24,920] | Elapsed: 268.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 我現在開上
Segment #299 [00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:25,840] | Elapsed: 268.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 小騎車了
Segment #300 [00:07:25,840 --> 00:07:26,600] | Elapsed: 268.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 那這說明
Segment #301 [00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:27,700] | Elapsed: 268.54s | Words: 3  | Text: 我的選擇
Segment #302 [00:07:27,700 --> 00:07:28,700] | Elapsed: 268.54s | Words: 3  | Text: 也許可能
Segment #303 [00:07:29,260 --> 00:07:29,580] | Elapsed: 268.54s | Words: 1  | Text: 沒錯
Segment #304 [00:07:29,960 --> 00:07:30,280] | Elapsed: 268.54s | Words: 1  | Text: 對不對
Segment #305 [00:07:30,900 --> 00:07:31,620] | Elapsed: 268.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 加油牧生人
Segment #306 [00:07:31,620 --> 00:07:32,600] | Elapsed: 268.54s | Words: 5  | Text: 最近越來越好
